Sector transition oracle hooks for JA2 Stracciatella (Strategy First SFI-SCLA), ja2-node 2026-10-16. See LICENSE (SFI-SCLA).
Exposes the static PickGridNoNearestEdge, PickGridNoToWalkIn, SoldierOKForSectorExit and SortSoldierInitList to
src/game/Oracle.cc, and marks every AddPlacementToWorld call in the Random draw trace of 0002 (begin: 1000 + node id,
end: 999), so tools/oracle/sector-compare.ts can replay only the placement decisions of
AddSoldierInitListEnemyDefenceSoldiers. Applied by tools/oracle/build.sh after 0003.

